==Restrictions==
Deploy from Row 1 only

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 4.67 seconds<sup>140f</sup>, delay 6~12 seconds<sup>180f~360f</sup>.
*8 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 6 seconds<sup>180f</sup>, delay 9.33~13.33 seconds<sup>280f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 15.33~19.33 seconds<sup>460f~580f</sup>.
*2 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*1 [[King's Mimic]] spawns as the boss after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spam [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Dark]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon]] and [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera]] Cats to win. To help speed things up, consider bringing a stat enhancing [[Cat Combo|Combo]] along.

